    "Question #: 3": {
      "Title": "Exam GED Test topic 1 question 18 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The three interior angles of angle JKL measure 45\u05b2\u00b0, 45\u05b2\u00b0, and 90\u05b2\u00b0. The three interior angles of angle PQR measure 45\u05b2\u00b0, 45\u05b2\u00b0, and 90\u05b2\u00b0. The side JK of JKL measures 4 cm. Based on the given information, which of the following must be a true statement?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Angle JKL and angle PQR are acute triangles."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. One side of angle PQR measures 4 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. The perimeter of angle JKL is 12 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Angle JKL and angle PQR are congruent triangles."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. Angle JKL and angle PQR are similar triangles."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: E \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Similar triangles have the same angle measures. Congruent triangles have the same angle measures and the same side lengths. From the given information, you cannot know if the side lengths are the same, so you can conclude only that the triangles are similar."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Similar triangles have the same angle measures. Congruent triangles have the same angle measures and the same side lengths. From the given information, you cannot know if the side lengths are the same, so you can conclude only that the triangles are similar."
          }
        ]
      },
